<title>USA: CCC seeks up to 45,000 T U.S. wheat for Ethiopia.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks up to 45,000 T U.S. wheat for Ethiopia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it is seeking up to 45,000 tonnes U.S. hard red winter wheat, maximum moisture 13.5 percent under the export donation program to Ethiopia.</p>
<p>Shipment period is slated for November 1-25 and offers are due by September 19.</p>
<p>The CCC, part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said the wheat must be tested for vomitoxin and originate in areas of the U.S. where Karnal Bunt is not known to occur.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
